[en.FOCUS_C04_START_OF_CHANGE]
The Start of Change

[en.FOCUS_C04_START_OF_CHANGE_desc]
Just as the Wonderbolts eventually disbanded no matter how brilliant they were, so shall Stratusburg move forward no matter how comfortable it is.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_START_OF_CHANGE]
变革的开始

[zh.FOCUS_C04_START_OF_CHANGE_desc]
正如闪电天马队无论多么辉煌，终有解散的那一天；无论层云堡多么安逸，也难以止步不前。

